#ETH In the crypto world, to earn 1 million with just a few thousand RMB, there’s only one way: rolling positions +. I once used 3,000 and made 110,000 in two days. Let me tell you how I used 3,000 to make 110,000 in one night;

Strictly speaking, it was 500U (about 3,500): I went through the whole process with three contract trades, as follows! First trade: opened a 60% position (100x), with holdings of about 30,000U, going long on Ethereum! That very day, during the night, a sudden piece of information came out: a U.S. official released a message roughly saying that the probability of the SEC approving an ETF9+ would be increased to 75%. Triggered by this stimulus, Ethereum+9 jumped nearly 20% in a single day; and I happened to catch almost the whole move—my capital surged from 500U to nearly 6,000U;

Second trade: using 6,000U, I opened 50% (100x) again, kept chasing the long, kept taking it, and kept being excited, kept being high! The next day I captured a move of nearly 1.5% (4,500U).

With the principal added, I was already at nearly 11,000U. Third trade: I took a small-cap coin BB move. Right when it was in its upward channel, I made a small swing!

I used nearly 11,000U to open a 20% contract (20x), meaning holdings of nearly 70,000U, and I took a trade of about 5,000U in profit. With these three trades, I turned 500U into 15,000U;

In this vast and dramatic sea of virtual currencies, from an old sailor who has weathered storms—going from cautious beginnings to now moving with ease—every step is filled with challenges and rewards.

